sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P1 as Player A (client)
  actor P2 as Player B (client)
  participant S as Server (authority)
  participant R as resolver.js

  Note over S: room.phase = PLANNING
  S->>P1: planningPhase { myActionsLeft, deadline, … }
  S->>P2: planningPhase { myActionsLeft, deadline, … }
  P1->>S: submitPlan { plan, round }
  S-->>P1: playerSubmitted
  P2->>S: submitPlan { plan, round }
  Note over S: all seats ready → _executeResolution
  S->>S: preState = serializeState(state)
  S->>R: resolvePlansMP(state, playerEntries)
  R-->>S: steps[] (live RNG, runs once)
  S->>S: finalizeRound() → phase/scoring/victory
  S->>S: finalState = serializeState(state)
  S->>P1: roundResolved { steps, gameState, round, lastRound }
  S->>P2: roundResolved { steps, gameState, round, lastRound }
  Note over P1,P2: clients REPLAY steps[] (never re-run resolver)
  Note over S: not game-over → next PLANNING phase
  loop every 15s
    S-->>P1: heartbeat { round, planningPhase, gameOver }
  end
  Note over P1,S: on mismatch P1 → requestState → full stateUpdate
